    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514140/extras/aec95da7ebdfd51642695273fefdc6fb.poster.avif?t=1708909308\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514140/extras/aec95da7ebdfd51642695273fefdc6fb.webm?t=1708909308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Get ready for an explosive local multiplayer showdown like no other in Tanked Out! Dive into a world of epic tank battles, unique maps and modes, and customization options that change how you play. All designed to deliver heart-pounding excitement and non-stop action. Dominate solo or on a team in any of the 6 ffa or 4 team maps across 5 different game modes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Your Tank!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514140/extras/dcf2ff1ef457e6c7bd44cf169ba38ac4.poster.avif?t=1708909308\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514140/extras/dcf2ff1ef457e6c7bd44cf169ba38ac4.webm?t=1708909308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514140/extras/dcf2ff1ef457e6c7bd44cf169ba38ac4.mp4?t=1708909308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bait your opponents!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514140/extras/35f8b86eb122b0e22bc73242fa52ff65.poster.avif?t=1708909308\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514140/extras/35f8b86eb122b0e22bc73242fa52ff65.webm?t=1708909308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514140/extras/35f8b86eb122b0e22bc73242fa52ff65.mp4?t=1708909308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don't blow yourself up!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514140/extras/9b20d8aeb37e14c6652e0610778fadf1.poster.avif?t=1708909308\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514140/extras/9b20d8aeb37e14c6652e0610778fadf1.webm?t=1708909308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514140/extras/9b20d8aeb37e14c6652e0610778fadf1.mp4?t=1708909308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LMAO!</h2>",
